{
    "title": "Beat Shooter Night: Rap Battle",
    "description": "Beat Night: Music Friends is a rhythm matching music game with full 7 weeks and all mods is here in Rap Battle Full Mod! \ufe0fTry your best to beat enemies in the rap battle and unlock all amazing songs. Numerous catchy songs and multiple gameplays are waiting for you to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe game has several roles: Boyfriend, Girlfriend, Daddy Dearest, Mommy Nearest, Monster, and Spirit. Besides, we have some guest characters like Tankman, Whitty, Skid, Pump and Pico. Those all mods shall be your opponents or arriving to save Boyfriend and Girlfriend that appear through all the songs in full week (week 7 included) in Friday  funny game.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 GAME FEATURES \ud83c\udfb6\r\n- Colorful magic Arrow in tune with rhythm\r\n\ufe0f- Catchy music background library with rhythm\r\n\ufe0f- Variety of levels along with different mods\r\n- Play online/offline mode anytime you want\r\n- Different difficulty makes more choices\r\n- Great sound effects like a true musical battle\r\n- Various Friday characters\r\n\ufe0f- Stunning graphics\r\n- All songs are completely free\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 HOW TO PLAY? \ud83c\udfb6\r\nThe gameplay of the All Mod game is very easy.\r\n- The opponent will sing a pattern of notes, you need to mirror by using the arrow keys.\r\n- Aim and shoot the arrow note as it reaches the scoring area, press and hold long arrows.\r\n- Follow rhythm to rock the beat.\r\n- Challenge yourself with all difficulty modes: Easy, Normal, or Hard.\r\n- Beat all zombies!\r\n- Get combos to get more coins and unlock new levels and mods!\r\n\r\nAs a music arrow game as well as a music battle game, to win all the battles of music in Friday night pumpkin, you should aim and shoot at the Arrow in time with the beat and the music so that you can achieve a higher score than your opponents.\r\n\r\nAre you ready for the freaky night? Welcome to Beat Night Show, a fun rhythm game, musical battle and dance revolution. Rap & dance with all mods, beat battle one by one. <b>Let's rock and roll Friday!</b>\r\n\r\nLet the Beat Shot: Gun Music Game drive you insane!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Beat Night: Music Friends is a rhythm matching music game with full 7 weeks and all mods is here in Rap Battle Full Mod! \ufe0fTry your best to beat enemies in the rap battle and unlock all amazing songs. Numerous catchy songs and multiple gameplays are waiting for you to enjoy.<br><br>The game has several roles: Boyfriend, Girlfriend, Daddy Dearest, Mommy Nearest, Monster, and Spirit. Besides, we have some guest characters like Tankman, Whitty, Skid, Pump and Pico. Those all mods shall be your opponents or arriving to save Boyfriend and Girlfriend that appear through all the songs in full week (week 7 included) in Friday  funny game.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 GAME FEATURES \ud83c\udfb6<br>- Colorful magic Arrow in tune with rhythm<br>\ufe0f- Catchy music background library with rhythm<br>\ufe0f- Variety of levels along with different mods<br>- Play online/offline mode anytime you want<br>- Different difficulty makes more choices<br>- Great sound effects like a true musical battle<br>- Various Friday characters<br>\ufe0f- Stunning graphics<br>- All songs are completely free<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 HOW TO PLAY? \ud83c\udfb6<br>The gameplay of the All Mod game is very easy.<br>- The opponent will sing a pattern of notes, you need to mirror by using the arrow keys.<br>- Aim and shoot the arrow note as it reaches the scoring area, press and hold long arrows.<br>- Follow rhythm to rock the beat.<br>- Challenge yourself with all difficulty modes: Easy, Normal, or Hard.<br>- Beat all zombies!<br>- Get combos to get more coins and unlock new levels and mods!<br><br>As a music arrow game as well as a music battle game, to win all the battles of music in Friday night pumpkin, you should aim and shoot at the Arrow in time with the beat and the music so that you can achieve a higher score than your opponents.<br><br>Are you ready for the freaky night? Welcome to Beat Night Show, a fun rhythm game, musical battle and dance revolution. Rap &amp; dance with all mods, beat battle one by one. <b>Let&#39;s rock and roll Friday!</b><br><br>Let the Beat Shot: Gun Music Game drive you insane!",
